From d61714e5af5a91d5133c9f9ea5cf2dda0d1e95b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 09:59:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 231/257] feat(execution): make the alias proof digest
 recomputable from plan/report

AliasProof now serializes the contract/capability/geometry/lifetime/overlap
facts and exposes recompute_alias_proof_digest(), so a report/plan reader can
re-derive the digest without re-running the resolver. Plan and report schemas
require the facts block; tampering the frozen alias decision is rejected.
